<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Cappa and D'Alberto profits rise.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Cappa and D'Alberto profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result for construction company Cappa and D'Alberto Nigeria Plc to end-March.</p>
<p>(In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				1996	     1995</p>
<p> Turnover		  1,500	   vs 967</p>
<p> Profit before taxation 142.3	  vs  59.1</p>
<p> Taxation		    33	    vs  17.9</p>
<p>Profit after</p>
<p>    taxation		109.3	  vs  41.2</p>
<p> Dividend		    50 kobo     vs  35 kobo</p>
<p>NOTE - The company also proposed one bonus share for every two ordinary shares.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
</text>
